{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06079","headline":"送祢郎中 · 王维","name":"送祢郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东郊春草色，驱马去悠悠。\n况复乡山外，猿啼湘水流。\n岛夷传露版，江馆候鸣驺。\n卉服爲诸吏，珠官拜本州。\n孤鸎吟远墅，野杏发山邮。\n早晚方归奏，南中才忌秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}